B.aJv=new A.n("love","I have a heart that never beats yet lovers chase me across centuries. What am I?","A love letter")
B.aNd=new A.n("love","Two share me but neither owns me alone; without trust I vanish. What am I?","A secret")
B.aRI=new A.n("love","Deep riddle #3 \u2014 I grow when given away in romance yet shrink when hoarded in silence. What am I?","Affection")
B.aX6=new A.n("love","I bind no rope yet hold two souls tighter than chains. What am I?","A vow")
B.aUx=new A.n("love","Challenge 5: Seen in eyes before spoken on lips; I arrive first at every true meeting. What am I?","Recognition")
B.aQc=new A.n("bible","Deep riddle #6 \u2014 I swallowed a man yet could not digest his prayer; I returned him on the third dawn. What am I?","The great fish")
B.aTo=new A.n("bible","Built with pitch and gopher wood, I rode forty days of rain. What am I? (Think carefully.)","Noah's ark")
B.aJw=new A.n("bible","I parted for a nation fleeing; walls of me stood like guards then fell flat. What am I?","The Red Sea")
B.aUi=new A.n("bible","Deep riddle #9 \u2014 Small in hand, giant on the field; one smooth stone ended my echo. What am I?","Goliath's challenge")
B.aLf=new A.n("bible","Challenge 10: I burned yet was not consumed; a bush spoke from within me. What am I?","The burning bush")
B.aVR=new A.n("street","I speak without a mouth on every corner; ignore me and pay a fine. What am I?","A traffic sign")
B.aJj=new A.n("street","Deep riddle #12 \u2014 I change color but never mood; red stops, green releases. What am I?","A stoplight")
B.aRz=new A.n("street","Rolling on four yet carrying hundreds; I stop every block but never walk. What am I?","A city bus")
B.aSz=new A.n("street","I am tagged in spray paint yet tell stories the city tries to erase. What am I? (Think carefully.)","Graffiti")
B.aO0=new A.n("street","Challenge 15: Sold from a window with no door; hunger knows my bell. What am I?","A food truck")
B.aS9=new A.n("church","I rise toward heaven yet stand on earth; bells call the faithful to me. What am I?","A steeple")
B.aKe=new A.n("church","Passed hand to hand yet never owned; peace lives in my circle. What am I?","The sign of peace")
B.aQy=new A.n("church","Deep riddle #18 \u2014 I am bread and wine yet become something greater in belief. What am I?","Communion")
B.aRf=new A.n("church","Whispered on knees, answered in seasons; I move mountains slowly. What am I?","Prayer")
B.aXj=new A.n("church","Challenge 20: I have no voice but every hymn passes through me. What am I?","A choir loft")
B.aS7=new A.n("logic","Deep riddle #21 \u2014 The more you take from me, the larger I become. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A hole")
B.aTX=new A.n("logic","I have cities but no houses, forests but no trees, water but no fish. What am I?","A map")
B.aSH=new A.n("logic","I speak without a mouth and hear without ears; I have no body but come alive with wind. What am I?","An echo")
B.aKZ=new A.n("logic","Deep riddle #24 \u2014 Born tall, I die short; every word I carry shrinks me. What am I?","A candle")
B.aSA=new A.n("logic","Challenge 25: I have keys but open no locks; space but no room; enter but not go inside. What am I?","A keyboard")
B.aS0=new A.n("nature","I fall but never get hurt; I blanket the world in white silence. What am I?","Snow")
B.aRo=new A.n("nature","Deep riddle #27 \u2014 I have no lungs yet I hold every breath of the forest. What am I?","A tree")
B.aX3=new A.n("mystery","I am seen in mirrors yet never in the same room twice. What am I? (Think carefully.)","Your reflection leaving")
B.aMM=new A.n("mystery","Doors open for me though I carry no key; time is my ally. What am I?","A habit")
